{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "00ae3d12d9bca52b4774bd22a227f6c4c5a3460c14a5896e08eee9b24330c6da", "ja": "近ごろ、いいお天気だな～。\n…秋にやるサーフィンって、\n気持ちがよくて楽しいんだよね♪", "zh": "最近天气很不错呢～\n……在秋天冲浪，\n真的很舒服、很好玩呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "db56583e5fff204f53d9ba7fe539659b6c8cc71758f7124f0c540ef447bb8653", "ja": "水温が温かくて泳ぎやすいし…\n今度のお休み、久しぶりに\n行ってみようかな？", "zh": "宜人的水温也很适合游泳……\n已经好久没去了，\n下次休假时要不要去一下呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "3e8876818f45e2dc929cbba7181120946c38373bbe24fcf12f42d2630bd2df4d", "ja": "誰か、誘ったら来るかなぁ…あ、\n響ちゃんと海美ちゃんはどうかな？\nサーフィン、誘ってみようかな。", "zh": "会有人愿意陪我吗……\n啊，去约约看响和海美好了。\n就找她们去冲浪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "c4527a41bdc53ad0158bb26fed50db245fe3f69bfc282add152ce89de369f01a", "ja": "お休みの予定も決まったし、\nお仕事頑張ろーっと♪　まずは、\n社長さんの伝言を伝えなきゃ！", "zh": "既然决定好休假的安排了，\n就来努力工作吧──♪\n得先帮社长传话才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
